{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"tower_stone","model_identifier":"tower_stone","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# tower_stone\n\nStone tower: a 3 x 3 column platform for ranged units, with a parapet and four standing points (`slot_tower_1..4`), a ladder or stair door at the back.\n\n- Footprint: 3 x 3 columns (48 x 48 units, 1.35 x 1.35 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -26..26, y 0..179, z -26..26 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 42, construction_0 15, construction_33 32, construction_66 39, ruined 7 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 48 x 178 x 48 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `tower_stone_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `tower_stone_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_tower_stone` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, 32)\n- `slot_tower_1` at (-12, 171, -12)\n- `slot_tower_2` at (12, 171, -12)\n- `slot_tower_3` at (-12, 171, 12)\n- `slot_tower_4` at (12, 171, 12)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"tw_base","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-26.0,0.0,-26.0],"to":[26.0,6.0,26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[62.0,205.0,114.0,211.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[62.0,205.0,114.0,211.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[62.0,205.0,114.0,211.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[62.0,205.0,114.0,211.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[87.0,0.0,139.0,52.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[87.0,0.0,139.0,52.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ff58ea16-a6d9-592b-bb5e-50283fb8bf94"},{"name":"tw_body","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24.0,6.0,-24.0],"to":[24.0,168.0,24.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,52.0,162.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,52.0,162.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,52.0,162.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,52.0,162.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[191.0,0.0,239.0,48.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[191.0,0.0,239.0,48.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"522cf10d-5686-504b-a903-186d8c3d2c84"},{"name":"tw_slit00","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,30.0,-24.5],"to":[1.0,40.0,-24.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[32.0,189.0,34.0,199.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[38.5,189.0,39.0,199.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[32.0,189.0,34.0,199.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[38.5,189.0,39.0,199.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[10.0,219.5,12.0,220.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[10.0,219.5,12.0,220.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8161985b-c94d-5d4a-9c14-f168d7a05617"},{"na